oolafOffice integration notice
==============================

This directory is formant's in-extension office suite, branded oolafOffice
(Quire / Ledger / Lectern). It is derived from VibeOffice (Apache-2.0):

  Upstream: https://github.com/tcchen2026/VibeOffice
  Site: https://vibeoffice.work
  License: Apache License 2.0 (full text in LICENSE)

The product name in this copy is oolafOffice. Upstream URLs above are kept
for attribution; formant does not phone vibeoffice.work.

Fonts in fonts/ are SIL Open Font License 1.1 (see fonts/LICENSES.txt).
Proofing word lists and thesaurus in common/dict/ have their own notices
(see common/dict/LICENSES.txt).

Modified for formant:

* Copied from VibeOffice public/ only (quire, ledger, lectern, common, fonts,
  icons, start page). Tauri desktop/, tests/, public/sw.js, the PWA
  manifest, and the published updater/ tree are not included.
* Inline <script> blocks were moved to external .js files so the pages
  load under the Chrome extension CSP (no inline scripts).
* common/suite.js skips remote update checks and page service-worker
  registration on chrome-extension: origins.
* PWA manifest links were removed; formant does not install oolafOffice
  as a standalone web app.
* Display name, comments, storage keys and this directory are oolafOffice
  / oolafoffice (IndexedDB and localStorage). XML keep-urn is
  urn:oolafoffice:keep.
* Ledger opens Excel 97–2003 binary workbooks (.xls, BIFF8) in
  ledger/js/xls.js; saving those files uses Save As .xlsx.

formant glue (feature flag, popup shortcut, context menus, option.html#features)
lives outside this directory in office-bridge.js and related formant files.
The editors still open and save .docx / .xlsx / .pptx on this machine
(Excel also opens Excel 97–2003 .xls, then Save As .xlsx);
nothing is uploaded to mono.
